Aim: Demonstrate two child classes inheriting one parent.

Algorithm: Start
define parent and two children
call methods
stop.

Program:

class Vehicle { void run(){System.out.println("Vehicle");} }
class Car extends Vehicle { void car(){System.out.println("Car");} }
class Bike extends Vehicle { void bike(){System.out.println("Bike");} }
class Hierarchical {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Car c=new Car(); c.run(); c.car();
        Bike b=new Bike(); b.run(); b.bike();
    }
}

Result: Vehicle, Car, Vehicle and Bike are displayed.

